lvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHope you liked it, and feedback is needed.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e","created_at":1473523736,"title":"Hidden Village [SkyWars]","replies":[{"id":333948,"author":"AbusiveUser","body":"The map looks good but I think the Islands are too flat. Maybe if you put more decoration in some parts in the Islands will be great!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eGood work in your map, I hope you can improve in your future maps!","body_tagged":"The map looks good but I think the Islands are too flat. Maybe if you put more decoration in some parts in the Islands will be great!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eGood work in your map, I hope you can improve in your future maps!","created_at":1473528929},{"id":333955,"author":"Bloodoh","body":"Gracias brokennz, vente al ts un seg","body_tagged":"Gracias brokennz, vente al ts un seg","created_at":1473531741,"reply_to":333948},{"id":334023,"author":"Xuph","body":"dear maxsusgabriel\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ea game of skywars unfortunately doesnt exist with 4 people only. make 12-16 starter island, doesnt matter how many \"bonus islands\" or secondary islands, and a wide big middle with space to mineman pvp.\u003cbr\u003ein this map particulary, the starter islands are very far from mid. they are placed in an order and shape that will not provide good gameplay. you need to take in account that people may want to rush to middle, or rush other people, etc. means \u0026gt; starter islands needs to be close to eachother, or at least in groups. secondary islands need to be close to the starter ones too, and then a slight bit far to bridge from them to the middle.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eyou could also add a little bit more detail\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ehmu on slack or ts if you need help with this map, gl\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ethanks, ericksen","body_tagged":"dear maxsusgabriel\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ea game of skywars unfortunately doesnt exist with 4 people only. make 12-16 starter island, doesnt matter how many \"bonus islands\" or secondary islands, and a wide big middle with space to mineman pvp.\u003cbr\u003ein this map particulary, the starter islands are very far from mid. they are placed in an order and shape that will not provide good gameplay. you need to take in account that people may want to rush to middle, or rush other people, etc. means \u0026gt; starter islands needs to be close to eachother, or at least in groups. secondary islands need to be close to the starter ones too, and then a slight bit far to bridge from them to the middle.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eyou could also add a little bit more detail\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ehmu on slack or ts if you need help with this map, gl\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ethanks, ericksen","created_at":1473567390},{"id":334039,"author":"cellish","body":"Im on for what Eric says, the map looks pretty good and stuff but you could add way more detail and stuff to make it look way better, and also, make like 8 islands orsomething because 4v4 is like really much nothing!!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBut nice job anyways!","body_tagged":"Im on for what Eric says, the map looks pretty good and stuff but you could add way more detail and stuff to make it look way better, and also, make like 8 islands orsomething because 4v4 is like really much nothing!!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBut nice job anyways!","created_at":1473577646},{"id":334099,"author":"Bloodoh","body":"@xuph its my first map , i will try to improve it!\u003cbr\u003e@piinqed thanks for the feedback!","body_tagged":"@xuph its my first map , i will try to improve it!\u003cbr\u003e@piinqed thanks for the feedback!","created_at":1473601646},{"id":337256,"author":"ProfessorUtonium","body":"Make this map either 1v1v1v1v1v1v1v1 (8 spawn islands) or increase the island sizes and make it 2v2v2v2\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf you edit the map like this, you have a higher chance of map acceptance.","body_tagged":"Make this map either 1v1v1v1v1v1v1v1 (8 spawn islands) or increase the island sizes and make it 2v2v2v2\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf you edit the map like this, you have a higher chance of map acceptance.","created_at":1475425266},{"id":338945,"author":"ProfessorUtonium","body":"I'm sorry to say but your map has been denied from the Avicus Network.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHere are the reasons why:\u003cbr\u003eRefer to my statement above (was not fixed)\u003cbr\u003eIslands are too small\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eToo much void for Skywars\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYou may resubmit your map once edited","body_tagged":"I'm sorry to say but your map has been denied from the Avicus Network.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHere are the reasons why:\u003cbr\u003eRefer to my statement above (was not fixed)\u003cbr\u003eIslands are too small\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eToo much void for Skywars\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYou may resubmit your map once edited","created_at":1476640982}]}